rows.07:1e3a4:
...It couldn't possibly be inside the toilet bowl itself, could it?
I searched every inch.
...Nothing.{p}

rows.07:1e96c:
Fukuzawa watched me as I fell.
She wore an almost entranced expression.
And that was the last sight I ever saw.{p}

rows.07:1ea4c:
I took the blow full on.
"Ugh!"
For an instant, my vision blurred.{p}

rows.07:1eaa8:
In that moment, Fukuzawa snatched up the ampoule.
"Too bad for you."
With that and a smug smile, Fukuzawa crushed the ampoule in her fist.{p}

rows.07:1ef10:
For the moment, I ran for it.
With the ampoule in my hands, I had no more business in a place like this.
But I tripped over the foot Fukuzawa quickly stuck out.{p}

rows.07:1f588:
A wave of heat, a crackling sound.
Fire!
I hurriedly dashed out of the bathroom.{p}

rows.07:1fbb4:
All or nothing!
I slipped right past Kazama.
Apparently even he hadn't expected me to charge straight at him.{p}

rows.07:1fc1c:
"Wh... why, you!"
A faint pain ran across my back.
Checking as I ran, I found the back of my shirt sliced clean open.{p}

rows.07:1fca8:
Kazama had a blade.
"Wait! Prey isn't allowed to get away!"
Kazama shouted as he chased after me.{p}
